The licence above covers this repository's own files: the program around the
emulator (waterbox/), the tests and the documents.

It does not cover PUAE. PUAE (extern/libretro-uae, a submodule) is the
libretro port of UAE, based on WinUAE, by the UAE and libretro authors, and
is under the GNU General Public License, version 2. The files under patches/
are changes to PUAE and are under the same licence.

The built package, puae.chimeraCore, holds PUAE compiled together with this
repository's program, and is distributed under the GNU General Public License
version 2. It holds no Kickstart ROM of Commodore's and no game.
